eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #7743\n\n## What\n\n`saas-extract.ts` capped six extracted text fields with raw UTF-16 slices — dated-read text (400), conflict lines (400), PAYG estimate note (300), PAYG not-applicable note (220), `usageNote` (600), and the `applySupabaseExport` metric note (600). An astral character straddling any cap was split, leaving a lone high surrogate in the `SaasService` field that is serialized into the feed/board JSON (stored as `\\ud83d`, read back as U+FFFD).\n\nThis adds a local `capUnits` helper to `saas-extract.ts` — mirroring the #7694/#7711 guard in `actions.ts` and the local copies in `comments.ts` (#7731) / `activity.ts` (#7725) — and routes all six caps through it: a pair straddling the cap is dropped whole, exact-fit pairs stay intact.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Probe `~/git/fleet/probe-saas-surrogate` (laptop, real module @ `752357c139ba`): all six straddle cases produced a lone `\\ud83d` with UTF-8 round-trip corruption pre-fix; exact-fit controls intact.\n- New suite `test/saas-extract-surrogate-7743.test.ts` (8 tests): the 6 straddle tests fail on the pre-fix code (verified by stashing the fix), the 2 exact-fit controls pass both ways.\n- Branch run: `bun test test/saas-extract-surrogate-7743.test.ts test/supabase-export.test.ts test/cloudflare-export.test.ts test/charges-catalog.test.ts test/saas-feed-gate.test.ts test/phase3-boundaries.test.ts` — 67 pass, 0 fail.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796743216&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7745&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7745&signature=b2ff5c078e78cef7427e5e6100872046942fbc28db43f30363077d14604cda21\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"htt